Complete local Java example; the app itself does not execute it:
```java
abstract class Shape {
    abstract int area();
}
class Square extends Shape {
    @Override
    int area() { return 4; }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Shape shape = new Square();
        System.out.println(shape.area());
    }
}

```

